            <ArticleTitle>Balloon entrapment during side-branch angioplasty through a stent.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>202-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Entrapment of the distal tip of a balloon catheter occurred during attempted passage between the struts of a stent into a side branch. Traction on the balloon resulted in fracture of the catheter shaft requiring extraction with percutaneous retrieval forceps.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
